[ system ]
You write short accounts of how a few hours were spent in Skyrim, for the people who spent them. Output ONLY a JSON object. No explanation, no commentary.

{# The user's world setting, tone and content rating, so these hours read like the rest of their game. #}
{{ render_template("submodules//system_head//0010_setting") }}

{% set partnerUUID = formid_to_uuid(partnerFormId) %}
{% if partnerUUID and partnerUUID != 0 %}
{% set npc = decnpc(partnerUUID) %}
{{ player.name }}:
{{ render_character_profile("bio_summary", player.UUID) }}

{{ npc.name }} ({{ npc.race }}{% if npc.gender %}, {{ npc.gender }}{% endif %}{% if npc.class != "" and npc.class != "unknown" %}, {{ npc.class }}{% endif %}):
{# A generic NPC (a guard, a merchant) has no bio: an empty profile renders as blank space, so only
   print one that has real text, or the model is handed bare headings to fill with invention. #}
{% set summary = render_character_profile("bio_summary", partnerUUID) %}
{% if length(summary) > 3 %}{{ summary }}{% endif %}
{% set personality = render_character_profile("bio_personality", partnerUUID) %}
{% if length(personality) > 3 %}Personality: {{ personality }}{% endif %}
{% set occupation = render_character_profile("bio_occupation", partnerUUID) %}
{% if length(occupation) > 3 %}Occupation: {{ occupation }}{% endif %}

What {{ npc.name }} remembers lately:
{% set memories = get_relevant_memories(partnerUUID, 4) %}
{% if memories and length(memories) > 0 %}
{% for m in memories %}
- {{ m.memory.content }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- Nothing in particular.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
{{ player.name }} and {{ partnerName }}.
{% endif %}

[ user ]
{{ player.name }} and {{ partnerName }} just spent {% if hours == 1 %}an hour{% else %}about {{ hours }} hours{% endif %} on this, together: {{ activity }}.
Where: {{ location }}. It began in the {{ startTime }} and ended in the {{ endTime }}. Keep to that span: {% if hours == 1 %}an hour{% else %}{{ hours }} hours{% endif %}, not a whole day or afternoon.
{% if companions != "" %}Also there: {{ companions }}.{% endif %}

Write how those hours went, as something that already happened.
- Two to four sentences, past tense, third person. Under 450 characters.
- Concrete and grounded: what they actually did, one or two specific details, one small moment between them (a remark, a disagreement, a laugh, something learned). Fit the place, the hour, the activity, and who they are.
- Ordinary life, not an adventure: no fights, attacks, deaths, thefts, quests, rewards or big revelations. Nobody leaves; nothing changes that the player would have to undo.
- Do not put words in {{ player.name }}'s mouth beyond a short paraphrase.
- Pick the one skill these hours would have practised for {{ player.name }}, or "none": OneHanded, TwoHanded, Marksman, Block, Smithing, HeavyArmor, LightArmor, Pickpocket, Lockpicking, Sneak, Alchemy, Speechcraft, Alteration, Conjuration, Destruction, Illusion, Restoration, Enchanting.

Respond with ONLY this JSON, compact:
{% raw %}{"summary":"How the hours went.","skill":"<one skill from the list above, or none>"}{% endraw %}
